			<div class="entry clearfix"><p>It is quite difficult to unleash the potential of each student in the class because each of them is a unique person. Children have different degrees of perception of new information, so each needs a special approach. The usual school curriculum has a standard method of presenting the material and not all students receive a &#8230;</p>
